_1=0.6\\,\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；D. 定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_2=2.0\\,\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；\nE. 滑动变阻器R；F. 电键和导线若干。根据提供的器材，设计电路如图1所示。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f3748b2e3cf6ef38a129f7e898957ae4d7935613f7135054e246f04bb7eeec77.png","width":374,"height":322,"width_mm":43.89,"row_group":"wenzhou-samo-2505-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-III题图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cec051434aa4838cf168be8e57896080efd86ed83dce261da28047bd4a65e6c4.png","width":474,"height":291,"width_mm":55.65,"row_group":"wenzhou-samo-2505-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-III题图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6ca5093b9ddfa45a894ac24de07a8abcc35e74510a6133070ecf3777426a6692.png","width":518,"height":334,"width_mm":66.99,"row_group":"wenzhou-samo-2505-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-III题图3\n（1）将毫安表与定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 改装成电流表如虚线框中所示，改装后的量程为 （填空） A；\n（2）为了精确测量，图中多用电表的右边表笔P应接到 （填空） 处（选填“B”或“C”）；\n（3）闭合电键，调节滑动变阻器滑片，多次记录多用电表的示数U、毫安表的示数I。\n其中一次测量时多用电表示数如图2所示，其读数为 （填空） V；\n（4）作U-I图线如图3所示，该干电池电动势 "},{"type":"math","value":"E="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空） V，内阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"r="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"（以上结果均保留三位有效数字）。\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:未特殊说明，重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"not_ingested","key":null,"body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--wenzhou-samo-2505-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--wenzhou-samo-2505","source_question_id":"wenzhou-samo-2505-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","热学"],"answer_status":"not_ingested","fingerprint":"868ecb4a14960bab3687f95e11f61e996c75f40e0dcdab0d144696a5d110dac1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）如图所示，活塞与棒固定连接形成整体——活塞棒，并将圆柱形密封腔体内的理想气体分成上下两部分，活塞上有一个面积可忽略的小孔，将上下两个区域的气体连通，所有衔接处均密封良好且无摩擦，腔体与外界导热良好。已知大气压强为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，柱形腔体高度 "